codex
The toolchain is installed and version-pinned, but the sandbox’s PID namespace makes `/proc/<getpid>/exe` unavailable while `/proc/self/exe` works; Lean 4.22 uses the former to locate its application. I’ll use a narrowly scoped `readlink` compatibility shim only for `/proc/<digits>/exe`, record its source and hash, and rerun the unmodified pinned Lean/Lake binaries. This does not touch candidate or generated sources.
apply patch
